DO $publish$ DECLARE j jsonb := $expected$[{"language":"es","slug":"morango-cravejado","public_path":"/morango-cravejado","title":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente","excerpt":"Morango cravejado brasileño: fresas enteras envueltas en brigadeiro blanco y cobertura blanca con trocitos de caramelo rojo. Receta para diez unidades, con enfriados incluidos.","summary":"Morango cravejado brasileño: fresas enteras envueltas en brigadeiro blanco y cobertura blanca con trocitos de caramelo rojo. Receta para diez unidades, con enfriados incluidos.","notes":"<p>Elige diez fresas firmes de unos 25 g, ya limpias y completamente secas. Usa cobertura blanca de repostería que no requiera templado; el chocolate blanco puro necesita su propio templado y no es intercambiable en el proceso. Contiene leche y puede contener soja. El caramelo a 150 °C quema: usa termómetro y utensilios secos, sin tocarlo hasta que esté frío. Guarda en nevera a 4 °C o menos y consume en 24 horas; la fruta suelta agua y el caramelo pierde crujiente. No se establece una vida útil comercial.</p><h2>También puedes preparar</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pasta-horno-calabaza-ricotta\">Pasta al horno con calabaza y ricotta, sin bechamel</a></li><li><a href=\"/patatas-bravas-freidora-aire\">Patatas bravas en freidora de aire con salsa casera</a></li></ul>","content_html":"<p>Morango cravejado brasileño: fresas enteras envueltas en brigadeiro blanco y cobertura blanca con trocitos de caramelo rojo. Receta para diez unidades, con enfriados incluidos.</p><p>Elige diez fresas firmes de unos 25 g, ya limpias y completamente secas. Usa cobertura blanca de repostería que no requiera templado; el chocolate blanco puro necesita su propio templado y no es intercambiable en el proceso. Contiene leche y puede contener soja. El caramelo a 150 °C quema: usa termómetro y utensilios secos, sin tocarlo hasta que esté frío. Guarda en nevera a 4 °C o menos y consume en 24 horas; la fruta suelta agua y el caramelo pierde crujiente. No se establece una vida útil comercial.</p><h2>También puedes preparar</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pasta-horno-calabaza-ricotta\">Pasta al horno con calabaza y ricotta, sin bechamel</a></li><li><a href=\"/patatas-bravas-freidora-aire\">Patatas bravas en freidora de aire con salsa casera</a></li></ul>","ingredients":[{"name":"fresas firmes limpias y muy secas, unas 10","amount":"250","unit":"g"},{"name":"leche condensada azucarada","amount":"395","unit":"g"},{"name":"nata líquida","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"leche entera en polvo","amount":"30","unit":"g"},{"name":"mantequilla","amount":"10","unit":"g"},{"name":"azúcar","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"agua","amount":"40","unit":"ml"},{"name":"vinagre blanco","amount":"5","unit":"ml"},{"name":"colorante alimentario rojo hidrosoluble, dosis según fabricante","amount":"1","unit":"g"},{"name":"cobertura blanca de repostería sin necesidad de templado","amount":"250","unit":"g"}],"steps":[{"title":"Limpia y seca las fresas","content":"Lava las fresas y sécalas completamente con papel limpio. Retira las hojas sin perforar la pulpa. Mantén refrigeradas y prepara una bandeja con papel de horno.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente: Limpia y seca las fresas"},{"title":"Cocina el brigadeiro","content":"Mezcla leche condensada, nata, leche en polvo y mantequilla en un cazo. Cocina a fuego medio-bajo 10–15 minutos, removiendo, hasta que se separe del fondo al inclinar.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente: Cocina el brigadeiro"},{"title":"Enfría la masa","content":"Pasa a un recipiente poco profundo, cubre la superficie y deja templar 20 minutos. Refrigera 2 horas o hasta obtener una masa fría que pueda moldearse.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente: Enfría la masa"},{"title":"Prepara el caramelo rojo","content":"Pon azúcar, agua, vinagre y colorante en un cazo seco. Mezcla antes de calentar; después hierve sin remover hasta 150 °C, controlando con termómetro.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente: Prepara el caramelo rojo"},{"title":"Enfría y rompe el caramelo","content":"Vierte con cuidado una capa fina sobre un tapete de silicona resistente al calor. Enfría por completo unos 20 minutos. Rompe dentro de una bolsa en trocitos pequeños.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente: Enfría y rompe el caramelo"},{"title":"Envuelve las fresas","content":"Divide el brigadeiro frío en diez porciones iguales. Aplana cada una con manos limpias ligeramente humedecidas y envuelve una fresa seca; cierra sin dejar huecos. Refrigera.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente: Envuelve las fresas"},{"title":"Baña con cobertura","content":"Derrite la cobertura siguiendo su envase, sin sobrecalentar. Cuando esté fluida y tibia, incorpora el caramelo frío. Baña cada fresa con un tenedor, escurre y coloca sobre papel.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente: Baña con cobertura"},{"title":"Deja fijar y sirve","content":"Deja fijar la cobertura según el envase y refrigera. Sirve diez unidades; corta una para mostrar fresa, brigadeiro y cubierta blanca con puntos rojos. Consume en 24 horas.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente: Deja fijar y sirve"}],"category":"Postres","course":"Postres","cuisine":"Brasileña","difficulty":"Media","prep_time_minutes":35,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":220,"servings":10,"image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente"}],"video_urls":[],"keywords":["Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente","fresas firmes limpias y muy secas, unas 10","leche condensada azucarada"],"nutrition":{"calories":370,"protein_g":5.3,"carbs_g":49.8,"fat_g":17.1,"saturated_fat_g":13.2,"fiber_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":75.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 de 10 porciones","source":"USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy + reference product labels","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/","method":"Suma de referencias por peso, dividida entre las porciones; todos los ingredientes principales contabilizados.","note":"Estimación orientativa, no medición del plato cocinado. Las marcas y el escurrido cambian los valores; los nutrientes sin dato completo no se muestran."},"seo":{"title":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente","description":"Morango cravejado brasileño: fresas enteras envueltas en brigadeiro blanco y cobertura blanca con trocitos de caramelo rojo. Receta para diez unidades, con enfriados incluidos.","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fresas con brigadeiro y cobertura crujiente","image_variants":["https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-1x1.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-4x3.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Es igual al morango do amor?","a":"Comparte la fresa y el brigadeiro. Aquí el caramelo rojo va en trocitos dentro de la cobertura blanca, en lugar de formar una cáscara roja continua."},{"q":"¿Por qué se humedece?","a":"La fruta desprende agua y el azúcar absorbe humedad. Seca muy bien las fresas, no perfores su pulpa y prepara para consumir en 24 horas."},{"q":"¿Puedo venderlo?","a":"Calcula ingredientes, envase, energía, trabajo y mermas por unidad. Antes de vender, valida higiene, conservación y vida útil con los requisitos locales; esta receta no los certifica."}],"rest_time_minutes":160},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","source_url":null,"source_post_id":null,"recipe_group_id":"c099d1b2-4be4-4893-8f92-27536b517373"},{"language":"de","slug":"morango-cravejado-erdbeerpralinen","public_path":"/de/morango-cravejado-erdbeerpralinen","title":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell","excerpt":"Brasilianische Erdbeeren in weißer Brigadeiro-Masse, umhüllt von weißer Glasur mit roten Karamellsplittern. Zehn Stück, einschließlich der Kühlzeiten.","summary":"Brasilianische Erdbeeren in weißer Brigadeiro-Masse, umhüllt von weißer Glasur mit roten Karamellsplittern. Zehn Stück, einschließlich der Kühlzeiten.","notes":"<p>Zehn feste, vollständig trockene Erdbeeren zu etwa 25 g verwenden. Weiße Fettglasur ohne Temperierpflicht nehmen; echte weiße Schokolade braucht einen anderen Ablauf. Enthält Milch, eventuell Soja. 150 °C heißer Zucker verbrennt: Thermometer, trockene Geräte und vollständiges Abkühlen sind nötig. Bei höchstens 4 °C lagern, innerhalb von 24 Stunden essen. Keine validierte gewerbliche Haltbarkeit.</p><h2>Auch ausprobieren</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/de/kuerbis-ricotta-nudelauflauf\">Kürbis-Ricotta-Nudelauflauf ohne Béchamel</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/patatas-bravas-heissluftfritteuse\">Patatas bravas aus der Heißluftfritteuse mit Paprikasauce</a></li></ul>","content_html":"<p>Brasilianische Erdbeeren in weißer Brigadeiro-Masse, umhüllt von weißer Glasur mit roten Karamellsplittern. Zehn Stück, einschließlich der Kühlzeiten.</p><p>Zehn feste, vollständig trockene Erdbeeren zu etwa 25 g verwenden. Weiße Fettglasur ohne Temperierpflicht nehmen; echte weiße Schokolade braucht einen anderen Ablauf. Enthält Milch, eventuell Soja. 150 °C heißer Zucker verbrennt: Thermometer, trockene Geräte und vollständiges Abkühlen sind nötig. Bei höchstens 4 °C lagern, innerhalb von 24 Stunden essen. Keine validierte gewerbliche Haltbarkeit.</p><h2>Auch ausprobieren</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/de/kuerbis-ricotta-nudelauflauf\">Kürbis-Ricotta-Nudelauflauf ohne Béchamel</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/patatas-bravas-heissluftfritteuse\">Patatas bravas aus der Heißluftfritteuse mit Paprikasauce</a></li></ul>","ingredients":[{"name":"feste Erdbeeren, geputzt und vollständig trocken, etwa zehn","amount":"250","unit":"g"},{"name":"gezuckerte Kondensmilch","amount":"395","unit":"g"},{"name":"Sahne","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"Vollmilchpulver","amount":"30","unit":"g"},{"name":"Butter","amount":"10","unit":"g"},{"name":"Zucker","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"Wasser","amount":"40","unit":"ml"},{"name":"weißer Essig","amount":"5","unit":"ml"},{"name":"wasserlösliche rote Lebensmittelfarbe nach Herstellerdosierung","amount":"1","unit":"g"},{"name":"weiße Fettglasur ohne Temperieren","amount":"250","unit":"g"}],"steps":[{"title":"Erdbeeren reinigen und trocknen","content":"Erdbeeren waschen und auf sauberem Papier vollständig trocknen. Blätter ohne Verletzung des Fruchtfleischs entfernen, kühlen und ein Blech mit Backpapier auslegen.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell: Erdbeeren reinigen und trocknen"},{"title":"Brigadeiro kochen","content":"Kondensmilch, Sahne, Milchpulver und Butter unter Rühren 10–15 Minuten bei mittlerer bis kleiner Hitze kochen, bis sich die Masse beim Neigen vom Topfboden löst.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell: Brigadeiro kochen"},{"title":"Masse kühlen","content":"Flach verteilen, Oberfläche abdecken und 20 Minuten abkühlen lassen. Mindestens 2 Stunden kühlen, bis die Masse kalt und formbar ist.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell: Masse kühlen"},{"title":"Roten Karamell kochen","content":"Zucker, Wasser, Essig und Farbe im trockenen Topf vor dem Erhitzen mischen. Danach ohne Rühren bis 150 °C laut Zuckerthermometer kochen.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell: Roten Karamell kochen"},{"title":"Abkühlen und zerkleinern","content":"Vorsichtig dünn auf eine hitzefeste Silikonmatte gießen. Etwa 20 Minuten vollständig erkalten lassen, dann im Lebensmittelbeutel klein zerbrechen.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell: Abkühlen und zerkleinern"},{"title":"Erdbeeren umhüllen","content":"Masse in zehn Portionen teilen. Mit sauberen, leicht angefeuchteten Händen flach drücken, je eine trockene Erdbeere lückenlos einhüllen und kühlen.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell: Erdbeeren umhüllen"},{"title":"In Glasur tauchen","content":"Glasur nach Packung schmelzen. Wenn flüssig und lauwarm, kalte Karamellstücke einrühren. Umhüllte Erdbeeren mit einer Gabel eintauchen, abtropfen lassen und auf Backpapier legen.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell: In Glasur tauchen"},{"title":"Fest werden lassen und servieren","content":"Glasur nach Packung fest werden lassen, danach kühlen. Zehn Stück servieren, eines zum Zeigen der Schichten halbieren. Innerhalb von 24 Stunden essen.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell: Fest werden lassen und servieren"}],"category":"Desserts","course":"Desserts","cuisine":"Brasilianisch","difficulty":"Mittel","prep_time_minutes":35,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":220,"servings":10,"image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell"}],"video_urls":[],"keywords":["Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell","feste Erdbeeren, geputzt und vollständig trocken, etwa zehn","gezuckerte Kondensmilch"],"nutrition":{"calories":370,"protein_g":5.3,"carbs_g":49.8,"fat_g":17.1,"saturated_fat_g":13.2,"fiber_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":75.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 von 10 Portionen","source":"USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy + reference product labels","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/","method":"Referenzwerte nach Zutatengewicht summiert und durch die Portionen geteilt.","note":"Ungefähre Schätzung, keine Messung des fertigen Gerichts. Marken und Abtropfen verändern die Werte; unvollständige Nährstoffdaten werden nicht angezeigt."},"seo":{"title":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell | Manual de Cocina","description":"Brasilianische Erdbeeren in weißer Brigadeiro-Masse, umhüllt von weißer Glasur mit roten Karamellsplittern. Zehn Stück, einschließlich der Kühlzeiten.","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: Erdbeerpralinen mit rotem Karamell","image_variants":["https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-1x1.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-4x3.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Ist das Morango do amor?","a":"Frucht und Brigadeiro sind ähnlich; hier sitzen Karamellsplitter in weißer Glasur statt einer durchgehenden roten Hülle."},{"q":"Warum wird die Hülle feucht?","a":"Erdbeeren geben Wasser ab, Zucker zieht Feuchtigkeit an. Früchte gründlich trocknen, nicht verletzen und innerhalb von 24 Stunden essen."},{"q":"Kann ich sie verkaufen?","a":"Zutaten, Verpackung, Energie, Arbeit und Verluste kalkulieren. Lokale Hygiene-, Lagerungs- und Haltbarkeitsanforderungen vor dem Verkauf validieren."}],"rest_time_minutes":160},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","source_url":null,"source_post_id":null,"recipe_group_id":"c099d1b2-4be4-4893-8f92-27536b517373"},{"language":"en","slug":"morango-cravejado-strawberry-bonbons","public_path":"/en/morango-cravejado-strawberry-bonbons","title":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons","excerpt":"Brazilian strawberries wrapped in white brigadeiro and a white confectionery shell studded with red caramel pieces. Makes ten bonbons, with cooling time included.","summary":"Brazilian strawberries wrapped in white brigadeiro and a white confectionery shell studded with red caramel pieces. Makes ten bonbons, with cooling time included.","notes":"<p>Use ten firm, fully dry strawberries, about 25 g each. Use white confectionery coating that needs no tempering; real white chocolate requires a different process. Contains milk and may contain soy. Sugar syrup at 150 °C causes burns: use a thermometer, dry equipment and cool completely before handling. Keep at 4 °C or below and eat within 24 hours. Commercial shelf life has not been validated.</p><h2>You may also like</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/en/pumpkin-ricotta-pasta-bake\">Pumpkin and ricotta pasta bake without béchamel</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/air-fryer-patatas-bravas\">Air fryer patatas bravas with homemade paprika sauce</a></li></ul>","content_html":"<p>Brazilian strawberries wrapped in white brigadeiro and a white confectionery shell studded with red caramel pieces. Makes ten bonbons, with cooling time included.</p><p>Use ten firm, fully dry strawberries, about 25 g each. Use white confectionery coating that needs no tempering; real white chocolate requires a different process. Contains milk and may contain soy. Sugar syrup at 150 °C causes burns: use a thermometer, dry equipment and cool completely before handling. Keep at 4 °C or below and eat within 24 hours. Commercial shelf life has not been validated.</p><h2>You may also like</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/en/pumpkin-ricotta-pasta-bake\">Pumpkin and ricotta pasta bake without béchamel</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/air-fryer-patatas-bravas\">Air fryer patatas bravas with homemade paprika sauce</a></li></ul>","ingredients":[{"name":"firm strawberries, cleaned and fully dried, about ten","amount":"250","unit":"g"},{"name":"sweetened condensed milk","amount":"395","unit":"g"},{"name":"cream","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"whole milk powder","amount":"30","unit":"g"},{"name":"butter","amount":"10","unit":"g"},{"name":"sugar","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"water","amount":"40","unit":"ml"},{"name":"white vinegar","amount":"5","unit":"ml"},{"name":"water-soluble red food colouring, manufacturer dose","amount":"1","unit":"g"},{"name":"white confectionery coating requiring no tempering","amount":"250","unit":"g"}],"steps":[{"title":"Clean and dry fruit","content":"Wash and completely dry strawberries on clean paper. Remove leaves without puncturing flesh. Refrigerate and line a tray with baking parchment.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons: Clean and dry fruit"},{"title":"Cook the brigadeiro","content":"Combine condensed milk, cream, milk powder and butter. Stir over medium-low heat 10–15 minutes until the mixture pulls away from the pan bottom when tilted.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons: Cook the brigadeiro"},{"title":"Chill the mixture","content":"Spread in a shallow container, cover the surface and cool 20 minutes. Refrigerate 2 hours or until cold and firm enough to shape.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons: Chill the mixture"},{"title":"Make red caramel","content":"Combine sugar, water, vinegar and colouring in a dry saucepan before heating. Boil without stirring until a candy thermometer reads 150 °C / 302 °F.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons: Make red caramel"},{"title":"Cool and crush","content":"Carefully pour a thin layer onto a heatproof silicone mat. Cool completely, about 20 minutes, then crush into small pieces inside a food bag.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons: Cool and crush"},{"title":"Wrap the strawberries","content":"Divide cold brigadeiro into ten portions. Flatten with clean, lightly dampened hands, enclose each dry strawberry without gaps and refrigerate.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons: Wrap the strawberries"},{"title":"Dip the bonbons","content":"Melt coating according to its packet. When fluid and lukewarm, fold in cold caramel pieces. Dip each wrapped strawberry using a fork, drain and place on parchment.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons: Dip the bonbons"},{"title":"Set and serve","content":"Let the shell set as directed, then refrigerate. Serve ten bonbons; halve one to show its layers. Eat within 24 hours.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons: Set and serve"}],"category":"Desserts","course":"Desserts","cuisine":"Brazilian","difficulty":"Medium","prep_time_minutes":35,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":220,"servings":10,"image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons"}],"video_urls":[],"keywords":["Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons","firm strawberries, cleaned and fully dried, about ten","sweetened condensed milk"],"nutrition":{"calories":370,"protein_g":5.3,"carbs_g":49.8,"fat_g":17.1,"saturated_fat_g":13.2,"fiber_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":75.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 of 10 servings","source":"USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy + reference product labels","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/","method":"Reference nutrients summed by ingredient weight and divided by servings.","note":"Approximate estimate, not a measurement of the cooked dish. Brands and draining change values; nutrients with incomplete data are omitted."},"seo":{"title":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons | Manual de Cocina","description":"Brazilian strawberries wrapped in white brigadeiro and a white confectionery shell studded with red caramel pieces. Makes ten bonbons, with cooling time included.","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: crunchy strawberry bonbons","image_variants":["https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-1x1.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-4x3.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Is this morango do amor?","a":"It shares the fruit and brigadeiro, but has caramel chips in a white shell rather than a continuous red shell."},{"q":"Why does the coating become damp?","a":"Fruit releases water and caramel absorbs moisture. Dry fruit thoroughly, do not puncture it and eat within 24 hours."},{"q":"Can I sell these?","a":"Calculate ingredients, packaging, energy, labour and waste per unit. Validate local hygiene, storage and shelf-life requirements before selling."}],"rest_time_minutes":160},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","source_url":null,"source_post_id":null,"recipe_group_id":"c099d1b2-4be4-4893-8f92-27536b517373"},{"language":"fr","slug":"morango-cravejado-fraises-croquantes","public_path":"/fr/morango-cravejado-fraises-croquantes","title":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge","excerpt":"Des fraises brésiliennes enveloppées de brigadeiro blanc et d’un enrobage blanc aux éclats de caramel rouge. Dix pièces avec les refroidissements inclus.","summary":"Des fraises brésiliennes enveloppées de brigadeiro blanc et d’un enrobage blanc aux éclats de caramel rouge. Dix pièces avec les refroidissements inclus.","notes":"<p>Choisissez dix fraises fermes et parfaitement sèches de 25 g environ. Utilisez un enrobage blanc de confiserie sans tempérage ; le vrai chocolat blanc exige un autre procédé. Contient lait et éventuellement soja. Le caramel à 150 °C brûle : thermomètre, matériel sec et refroidissement complet sont nécessaires. Gardez à 4 °C maximum et mangez sous 24 heures. Aucune durée de conservation commerciale n’est validée.</p><h2>À préparer aussi</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/fr/gratin-pates-courge-ricotta\">Gratin de pâtes à la courge et ricotta sans béchamel</a></li><li><a href=\"/fr/patatas-bravas-airfryer\">Patatas bravas à l’air fryer et sauce paprika maison</a></li></ul>","content_html":"<p>Des fraises brésiliennes enveloppées de brigadeiro blanc et d’un enrobage blanc aux éclats de caramel rouge. Dix pièces avec les refroidissements inclus.</p><p>Choisissez dix fraises fermes et parfaitement sèches de 25 g environ. Utilisez un enrobage blanc de confiserie sans tempérage ; le vrai chocolat blanc exige un autre procédé. Contient lait et éventuellement soja. Le caramel à 150 °C brûle : thermomètre, matériel sec et refroidissement complet sont nécessaires. Gardez à 4 °C maximum et mangez sous 24 heures. Aucune durée de conservation commerciale n’est validée.</p><h2>À préparer aussi</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/fr/gratin-pates-courge-ricotta\">Gratin de pâtes à la courge et ricotta sans béchamel</a></li><li><a href=\"/fr/patatas-bravas-airfryer\">Patatas bravas à l’air fryer et sauce paprika maison</a></li></ul>","ingredients":[{"name":"fraises fermes nettoyées et parfaitement sèches, environ dix","amount":"250","unit":"g"},{"name":"lait concentré sucré","amount":"395","unit":"g"},{"name":"crème liquide","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"lait entier en poudre","amount":"30","unit":"g"},{"name":"beurre","amount":"10","unit":"g"},{"name":"sucre","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"eau","amount":"40","unit":"ml"},{"name":"vinaigre blanc","amount":"5","unit":"ml"},{"name":"colorant alimentaire rouge hydrosoluble, dose du fabricant","amount":"1","unit":"g"},{"name":"enrobage blanc de confiserie sans tempérage","amount":"250","unit":"g"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lavez et séchez les fraises","content":"Lavez puis séchez entièrement sur du papier propre. Retirez les feuilles sans percer la chair. Réfrigérez et tapissez une plaque de papier cuisson.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge: Lavez et séchez les fraises"},{"title":"Cuisez le brigadeiro","content":"Mélangez lait concentré, crème, lait en poudre et beurre. Remuez 10–15 minutes à feu moyen-doux, jusqu’à ce que la masse se détache du fond en inclinant.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge: Cuisez le brigadeiro"},{"title":"Refroidissez la pâte","content":"Étalez dans un récipient peu profond, filmez au contact et laissez tiédir 20 minutes. Réfrigérez 2 heures ou jusqu’à une pâte froide et modelable.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge: Refroidissez la pâte"},{"title":"Cuisez le caramel rouge","content":"Mélangez sucre, eau, vinaigre et colorant dans un récipient sec avant de chauffer. Faites bouillir sans remuer jusqu’à 150 °C au thermomètre.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge: Cuisez le caramel rouge"},{"title":"Refroidissez et concassez","content":"Versez prudemment une couche fine sur un tapis de silicone résistant à la chaleur. Refroidissez complètement environ 20 minutes, puis concassez en sachet alimentaire.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge: Refroidissez et concassez"},{"title":"Enveloppez les fraises","content":"Divisez le brigadeiro en dix portions. Aplatissez avec les mains propres légèrement humides et enveloppez chaque fraise sèche sans trou. Réfrigérez.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge: Enveloppez les fraises"},{"title":"Enrobez les bonbons","content":"Faites fondre l’enrobage selon le paquet. Fluide et tiède, mélangez-le au caramel froid. Trempez chaque fraise à la fourchette, égouttez et posez sur papier.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge: Enrobez les bonbons"},{"title":"Laissez figer et servez","content":"Laissez figer selon le fabricant puis réfrigérez. Servez dix pièces, dont une coupée pour montrer les couches. Consommez sous 24 heures.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge: Laissez figer et servez"}],"category":"Desserts","course":"Desserts","cuisine":"Brésilienne","difficulty":"Moyenne","prep_time_minutes":35,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":220,"servings":10,"image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge"}],"video_urls":[],"keywords":["Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge","fraises fermes nettoyées et parfaitement sèches, environ dix","lait concentré sucré"],"nutrition":{"calories":370,"protein_g":5.3,"carbs_g":49.8,"fat_g":17.1,"saturated_fat_g":13.2,"fiber_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":75.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 des 10 portions","source":"USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy + reference product labels","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/","method":"Somme des références selon le poids des ingrédients, divisée par le nombre de portions.","note":"Estimation indicative, pas une mesure du plat cuisiné. Marques et égouttage changent les valeurs ; les nutriments incomplets ne sont pas affichés."},"seo":{"title":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge | Manual de Cocina","description":"Des fraises brésiliennes enveloppées de brigadeiro blanc et d’un enrobage blanc aux éclats de caramel rouge. Dix pièces avec les refroidissements inclus.","image_alt":"Morango cravejado : fraises enrobées au caramel rouge","image_variants":["https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-1x1.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-4x3.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Est-ce le morango do amor ?","a":"La fraise et le brigadeiro sont similaires, mais le caramel est en éclats dans l’enrobage blanc, pas en coque rouge continue."},{"q":"Pourquoi l’enrobage s’humidifie-t-il ?","a":"La fraise libère de l’eau et le caramel l’absorbe. Séchez bien, ne percez pas le fruit et consommez sous 24 heures."},{"q":"Peut-on les vendre ?","a":"Calculez ingrédients, emballage, énergie, travail et pertes par pièce. Validez les exigences locales d’hygiène, conservation et durée de vie avant vente."}],"rest_time_minutes":160},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","source_url":null,"source_post_id":null,"recipe_group_id":"c099d1b2-4be4-4893-8f92-27536b517373"},{"language":"it","slug":"morango-cravejado-fragole-croccanti","public_path":"/it/morango-cravejado-fragole-croccanti","title":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso","excerpt":"Fragole brasiliane avvolte in brigadeiro bianco e copertura bianca con frammenti di caramello rosso. Dieci dolcetti, con tempi di raffreddamento inclusi.","summary":"Fragole brasiliane avvolte in brigadeiro bianco e copertura bianca con frammenti di caramello rosso. Dieci dolcetti, con tempi di raffreddamento inclusi.","notes":"<p>Scegli dieci fragole sode di circa 25 g, completamente asciutte. Usa copertura bianca da pasticceria senza temperaggio; il cioccolato bianco puro richiede un procedimento diverso. Contiene latte e può contenere soia. Il caramello a 150 °C ustiona: usa termometro, utensili asciutti e raffredda prima di toccare. Conserva a 4 °C o meno e consuma entro 24 ore. Durata commerciale non validata.</p><h2>Da provare anche</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/it/pasta-forno-zucca-ricotta\">Pasta al forno con zucca e ricotta senza besciamella</a></li><li><a href=\"/it/patatas-bravas-friggitrice-aria\">Patatas bravas in friggitrice ad aria con salsa alla paprika</a></li></ul>","content_html":"<p>Fragole brasiliane avvolte in brigadeiro bianco e copertura bianca con frammenti di caramello rosso. Dieci dolcetti, con tempi di raffreddamento inclusi.</p><p>Scegli dieci fragole sode di circa 25 g, completamente asciutte. Usa copertura bianca da pasticceria senza temperaggio; il cioccolato bianco puro richiede un procedimento diverso. Contiene latte e può contenere soia. Il caramello a 150 °C ustiona: usa termometro, utensili asciutti e raffredda prima di toccare. Conserva a 4 °C o meno e consuma entro 24 ore. Durata commerciale non validata.</p><h2>Da provare anche</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/it/pasta-forno-zucca-ricotta\">Pasta al forno con zucca e ricotta senza besciamella</a></li><li><a href=\"/it/patatas-bravas-friggitrice-aria\">Patatas bravas in friggitrice ad aria con salsa alla paprika</a></li></ul>","ingredients":[{"name":"fragole sode pulite e perfettamente asciutte, circa dieci","amount":"250","unit":"g"},{"name":"latte condensato zuccherato","amount":"395","unit":"g"},{"name":"panna liquida","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"latte intero in polvere","amount":"30","unit":"g"},{"name":"burro","amount":"10","unit":"g"},{"name":"zucchero","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"acqua","amount":"40","unit":"ml"},{"name":"aceto bianco","amount":"5","unit":"ml"},{"name":"colorante alimentare rosso idrosolubile, dose del produttore","amount":"1","unit":"g"},{"name":"copertura bianca da pasticceria senza temperaggio","amount":"250","unit":"g"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lava e asciuga le fragole","content":"Lava e asciuga completamente su carta pulita. Elimina le foglie senza forare la polpa, conserva al freddo e rivesti una teglia con carta forno.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso: Lava e asciuga le fragole"},{"title":"Cuoci il brigadeiro","content":"Mescola latte condensato, panna, latte in polvere e burro. Cuoci mescolando 10–15 minuti a fuoco medio-basso, finché la massa si stacca dal fondo inclinando.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso: Cuoci il brigadeiro"},{"title":"Raffredda la massa","content":"Stendi in un contenitore basso, copri a contatto e fai intiepidire 20 minuti. Refrigerare 2 ore o finché fredda e modellabile.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso: Raffredda la massa"},{"title":"Prepara il caramello","content":"Mescola zucchero, acqua, aceto e colorante in un pentolino asciutto prima di scaldare. Fai bollire senza mescolare fino a 150 °C con termometro.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso: Prepara il caramello"},{"title":"Raffredda e spezza","content":"Versa con cautela uno strato sottile su silicone resistente al calore. Raffredda completamente circa 20 minuti, poi spezza in un sacchetto alimentare.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso: Raffredda e spezza"},{"title":"Avvolgi le fragole","content":"Dividi il brigadeiro in dieci porzioni. Appiattisci con mani pulite appena umide e racchiudi ogni fragola asciutta senza buchi. Refrigerare.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso: Avvolgi le fragole"},{"title":"Immergi nella copertura","content":"Sciogli la copertura seguendo la confezione. Fluida e tiepida, mescola il caramello freddo. Immergi ogni fragola con una forchetta, scola e posa sulla carta.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso: Immergi nella copertura"},{"title":"Fai solidificare e servi","content":"Lascia solidificare come da confezione, poi refrigera. Servi dieci dolcetti, tagliandone uno per mostrare gli strati. Consuma entro 24 ore.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso: Fai solidificare e servi"}],"category":"Dolci","course":"Dolci","cuisine":"Brasiliana","difficulty":"Media","prep_time_minutes":35,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":220,"servings":10,"image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso"}],"video_urls":[],"keywords":["Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso","fragole sode pulite e perfettamente asciutte, circa dieci","latte condensato zuccherato"],"nutrition":{"calories":370,"protein_g":5.3,"carbs_g":49.8,"fat_g":17.1,"saturated_fat_g":13.2,"fiber_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":75.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 di 10 porzioni","source":"USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy + reference product labels","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/","method":"Somma dei valori di riferimento per peso, divisa per le porzioni.","note":"Stima indicativa, non misurazione del piatto cotto. Marche e scolatura modificano i valori; nutrienti con dati incompleti non sono mostrati."},"seo":{"title":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso","description":"Fragole brasiliane avvolte in brigadeiro bianco e copertura bianca con frammenti di caramello rosso. Dieci dolcetti, con tempi di raffreddamento inclusi.","image_alt":"Morango cravejado: fragole al brigadeiro e caramello rosso","image_variants":["https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-1x1.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-4x3.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"È il morango do amor?","a":"Condivide fragola e brigadeiro, ma il caramello è in frammenti nella copertura bianca anziché in un guscio rosso continuo."},{"q":"Perché si inumidisce?","a":"La frutta rilascia acqua e il caramello assorbe umidità. Asciuga bene, non forare la polpa e consuma entro 24 ore."},{"q":"Posso venderlo?","a":"Calcola ingredienti, confezione, energia, lavoro e scarti per pezzo. Prima della vendita valida igiene, conservazione e durata secondo i requisiti locali."}],"rest_time_minutes":160},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","source_url":null,"source_post_id":null,"recipe_group_id":"c099d1b2-4be4-4893-8f92-27536b517373"},{"language":"ja","slug":"morango-cravejado","public_path":"/ja/morango-cravejado","title":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子","excerpt":"いちごを白いブリガデイロで包み、赤いカラメル片を混ぜた白いコーティングで仕上げるブラジル菓子。10個分で冷却時間も含みます。","summary":"いちごを白いブリガデイロで包み、赤いカラメル片を混ぜた白いコーティングで仕上げるブラジル菓子。10個分で冷却時間も含みます。","notes":"<p>約25 gの固めのいちご10個を完全に乾かして使います。テンパリング不要の白い製菓用コーティングを使い、純粋なホワイトチョコの工程とは異なります。乳、商品により大豆を含みます。150 °Cの砂糖液はやけどの危険があるため、温度計と乾いた器具を使い、冷えるまで触りません。4 °C以下で冷蔵し24時間以内に食べます。販売用の保存期限は検証していません。</p><h2>こちらのレシピも</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/ja/pumpkin-ricotta-pasta-bake\">かぼちゃとリコッタの焼きパスタ、ベシャメルなし</a></li><li><a href=\"/ja/air-fryer-patatas-bravas\">エアフライヤーで作るパタタス・ブラバス</a></li></ul>","content_html":"<p>いちごを白いブリガデイロで包み、赤いカラメル片を混ぜた白いコーティングで仕上げるブラジル菓子。10個分で冷却時間も含みます。</p><p>約25 gの固めのいちご10個を完全に乾かして使います。テンパリング不要の白い製菓用コーティングを使い、純粋なホワイトチョコの工程とは異なります。乳、商品により大豆を含みます。150 °Cの砂糖液はやけどの危険があるため、温度計と乾いた器具を使い、冷えるまで触りません。4 °C以下で冷蔵し24時間以内に食べます。販売用の保存期限は検証していません。</p><h2>こちらのレシピも</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/ja/pumpkin-ricotta-pasta-bake\">かぼちゃとリコッタの焼きパスタ、ベシャメルなし</a></li><li><a href=\"/ja/air-fryer-patatas-bravas\">エアフライヤーで作るパタタス・ブラバス</a></li></ul>","ingredients":[{"name":"固めのいちご、洗って完全に乾かしたもの約10個","amount":"250","unit":"g"},{"name":"加糖練乳","amount":"395","unit":"g"},{"name":"生クリーム","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"全脂粉乳","amount":"30","unit":"g"},{"name":"バター","amount":"10","unit":"g"},{"name":"砂糖","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"水","amount":"40","unit":"ml"},{"name":"ホワイトビネガー","amount":"5","unit":"ml"},{"name":"水溶性の赤い食用色素、メーカー指定量","amount":"1","unit":"g"},{"name":"テンパリング不要の白い製菓用コーティング","amount":"250","unit":"g"}],"steps":[{"title":"いちごを洗って乾かす","content":"洗って清潔なペーパーで完全に乾かします。果肉を傷つけずにへたを取り、冷蔵します。天板にオーブンシートを敷きます。","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子: いちごを洗って乾かす"},{"title":"ブリガデイロを煮る","content":"練乳、生クリーム、粉乳、バターを混ぜ、中弱火で10〜15分混ぜ続けます。鍋を傾けると生地が底から離れるまで煮ます。","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子: ブリガデイロを煮る"},{"title":"生地を冷やす","content":"浅い容器に広げ、表面に密着させて覆い、20分粗熱を取ります。冷蔵庫で2時間、冷たく成形できる固さまで冷やします。","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子: 生地を冷やす"},{"title":"赤いカラメルを作る","content":"乾いた鍋で砂糖、水、酢、色素を加熱前に混ぜます。以後は混ぜずに沸かし、菓子用温度計で150 °Cまで加熱します。","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子: 赤いカラメルを作る"},{"title":"冷やして砕く","content":"耐熱シリコンマットに注意して薄く流します。約20分完全に冷まし、食品用袋の中で小さく砕きます。","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子: 冷やして砕く"},{"title":"いちごを包む","content":"冷たい生地を10等分します。清潔で軽く湿らせた手で広げ、乾いたいちごを隙間なく包んで冷蔵します。","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子: いちごを包む"},{"title":"コーティングする","content":"コーティングを袋の指示通りに溶かします。流れる程度のぬるさになったら冷たいカラメル片を混ぜ、フォークでいちごを浸し、余分を切ってシートに置きます。","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子: コーティングする"},{"title":"固めて盛る","content":"商品指示に従って固めてから冷蔵します。10個を盛り、1個切って層を見せます。24時間以内に食べます。","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子: 固めて盛る"}],"category":"デザート","course":"デザート","cuisine":"ブラジル料理","difficulty":"中級","prep_time_minutes":35,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":220,"servings":10,"image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子"}],"video_urls":[],"keywords":["モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子","固めのいちご、洗って完全に乾かしたもの約10個","加糖練乳"],"nutrition":{"calories":370,"protein_g":5.3,"carbs_g":49.8,"fat_g":17.1,"saturated_fat_g":13.2,"fiber_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":75.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"全10人分のうち1人分","source":"USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy + reference product labels","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/","method":"材料の重量に応じた参考栄養値を合計し、人数で割っています。","note":"調理済み料理の実測値ではなく概算です。商品や水切りで変わり、資料がそろわない栄養素は表示しません。"},"seo":{"title":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子 | Manual de Cocina","description":"いちごを白いブリガデイロで包み、赤いカラメル片を混ぜた白いコーティングで仕上げるブラジル菓子。10個分で冷却時間も含みます。","image_alt":"モランゴ・クラヴェジャード：いちごのブラジル菓子","image_variants":["https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-1x1.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-4x3.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"モランゴ・ド・アモールと同じですか？","a":"いちごとブリガデイロは共通ですが、こちらは赤い殻で覆わず、白いコーティングに赤いカラメル片を混ぜます。"},{"q":"湿ってしまうのはなぜ？","a":"果物の水分と砂糖の吸湿が原因です。十分乾かし、果肉を傷つけず、24時間以内に食べます。"},{"q":"販売できますか？","a":"材料、包装、光熱費、作業、ロスを1個ずつ計算します。販売前に地域の衛生・保存・期限の条件を別途検証してください。"}],"rest_time_minutes":160},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","source_url":null,"source_post_id":null,"recipe_group_id":"c099d1b2-4be4-4893-8f92-27536b517373"},{"language":"pt","slug":"morango-cravejado","public_path":"/pt/morango-cravejado","title":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo","excerpt":"Morango cravejado com fruta inteira, brigadeiro de leite em pó e cobertura branca com pedacinhos de caramelo vermelho. Dez unidades, com os tempos de resfriamento incluídos.","summary":"Morango cravejado com fruta inteira, brigadeiro de leite em pó e cobertura branca com pedacinhos de caramelo vermelho. Dez unidades, com os tempos de resfriamento incluídos.","notes":"<p>Escolha dez morangos firmes de cerca de 25 g, totalmente secos. Use cobertura branca fracionada que dispense temperagem; chocolate branco nobre exige outro processo. Contém leite e pode conter soja. Calda a 150 °C queima: use termômetro e utensílios secos e espere esfriar completamente antes de tocar. Guarde a 4 °C ou menos e consuma em 24 horas. A validade comercial não foi validada.</p><h2>Prepare também</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pt/macarrao-forno-abobora-ricota\">Macarrão de forno com abóbora e ricota sem molho branco</a></li><li><a href=\"/pt/batatas-bravas-airfryer\">Batatas bravas na air fryer com molho de páprica</a></li></ul>","content_html":"<p>Morango cravejado com fruta inteira, brigadeiro de leite em pó e cobertura branca com pedacinhos de caramelo vermelho. Dez unidades, com os tempos de resfriamento incluídos.</p><p>Escolha dez morangos firmes de cerca de 25 g, totalmente secos. Use cobertura branca fracionada que dispense temperagem; chocolate branco nobre exige outro processo. Contém leite e pode conter soja. Calda a 150 °C queima: use termômetro e utensílios secos e espere esfriar completamente antes de tocar. Guarde a 4 °C ou menos e consuma em 24 horas. A validade comercial não foi validada.</p><h2>Prepare também</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pt/macarrao-forno-abobora-ricota\">Macarrão de forno com abóbora e ricota sem molho branco</a></li><li><a href=\"/pt/batatas-bravas-airfryer\">Batatas bravas na air fryer com molho de páprica</a></li></ul>","ingredients":[{"name":"morangos firmes limpos e muito secos, cerca de dez","amount":"250","unit":"g"},{"name":"leite condensado","amount":"395","unit":"g"},{"name":"creme de leite","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"leite em pó integral","amount":"30","unit":"g"},{"name":"manteiga","amount":"10","unit":"g"},{"name":"açúcar","amount":"100","unit":"g"},{"name":"água","amount":"40","unit":"ml"},{"name":"vinagre branco","amount":"5","unit":"ml"},{"name":"corante alimentício vermelho hidrossolúvel, dose do fabricante","amount":"1","unit":"g"},{"name":"cobertura branca fracionada que dispensa temperagem","amount":"250","unit":"g"}],"steps":[{"title":"Higienize e seque os morangos","content":"Lave e seque completamente em papel limpo. Retire as folhas sem perfurar a polpa. Mantenha refrigerados e forre uma bandeja com papel-manteiga.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo: Higienize e seque os morangos"},{"title":"Cozinhe o brigadeiro","content":"Misture leite condensado, creme de leite, leite em pó e manteiga. Mexa em fogo médio-baixo por 10–15 minutos, até a massa soltar do fundo ao inclinar.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo: Cozinhe o brigadeiro"},{"title":"Esfrie a massa","content":"Espalhe em recipiente raso, cubra em contato e deixe amornar 20 minutos. Refrigere por 2 horas ou até ficar fria e modelável.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo: Esfrie a massa"},{"title":"Faça o caramelo vermelho","content":"Misture açúcar, água, vinagre e corante numa panela seca antes de aquecer. Depois ferva sem mexer até 150 °C, controlando com termômetro culinário.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo: Faça o caramelo vermelho"},{"title":"Esfrie e quebre o caramelo","content":"Despeje cuidadosamente uma camada fina em tapete de silicone resistente ao calor. Espere esfriar por completo, cerca de 20 minutos, e quebre em pedacinhos dentro de saco alimentar.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo: Esfrie e quebre o caramelo"},{"title":"Envolva os morangos","content":"Divida o brigadeiro frio em dez porções. Abra com mãos limpas levemente úmidas, envolva cada morango seco sem deixar espaços e refrigere.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo: Envolva os morangos"},{"title":"Banhe na cobertura","content":"Derreta a cobertura conforme a embalagem. Fluida e morna, misture os pedacinhos frios de caramelo. Banhe cada morango com garfo, escorra e coloque no papel.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo: Banhe na cobertura"},{"title":"Deixe firmar e sirva","content":"Deixe a cobertura firmar conforme a embalagem e refrigere. Sirva dez unidades, cortando uma para mostrar as camadas. Consuma em 24 horas.","image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo: Deixe firmar e sirva"}],"category":"Sobremesas","course":"Sobremesas","cuisine":"Brasileira","difficulty":"Média","prep_time_minutes":35,"cook_time_minutes":25,"total_time_minutes":220,"servings":10,"image_url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada.webp","alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo"}],"video_urls":[],"keywords":["Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo","morangos firmes limpos e muito secos, cerca de dez","leite condensado"],"nutrition":{"calories":370,"protein_g":5.3,"carbs_g":49.8,"fat_g":17.1,"saturated_fat_g":13.2,"fiber_g":0.5,"sodium_mg":75.6,"estimated":true,"serving_size":"1 das 10 porções","source":"USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy + reference product labels","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/","method":"Soma das referências pelo peso dos ingredientes, dividida pelas porções.","note":"Estimativa orientativa, não medição do prato pronto. Marcas e escorrimento alteram os valores; nutrientes com dados incompletos não são mostrados."},"seo":{"title":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo | Manual de Cocina","description":"Morango cravejado com fruta inteira, brigadeiro de leite em pó e cobertura branca com pedacinhos de caramelo vermelho. Dez unidades, com os tempos de resfriamento incluídos.","image_alt":"Morango cravejado com brigadeiro branco e caramelo","image_variants":["https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-1x1.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-4x3.webp","https://eqbdtctxbpepbeickhqi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recetas/morango-cravejado/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"É igual ao morango do amor?","a":"A fruta e o brigadeiro são parecidos; aqui o caramelo fica em pedacinhos na cobertura branca, sem casquinha vermelha contínua."},{"q":"Por que fica úmido?","a":"A fruta solta água e o caramelo absorve umidade. Seque bem, não perfure a polpa e consuma em 24 horas."},{"q":"Posso fazer para vender?","a":"Calcule ingredientes, embalagem, energia, trabalho e perdas por unidade. Antes de vender, valide higiene, conservação e validade conforme as exigências locais."}],"rest_time_minutes":160},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","source_url":null,"source_post_id":null,"recipe_group_id":"c099d1b2-4be4-4893-8f92-27536b517373"}]$expected$::jsonb; x jsonb; v public.recipes; n int:=0;
